1. The app (src/, public/, tests/, e2e/ and the build configuration)
--------------------------------------------------------------------

The app is a modified version ("fork") of FreqUI, https://github.com/freqtrade/frequi
  Copyright (C) the FreqUI / Freqtrade contributors
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
  Forked from FreqUI release 3.1.2 (commit f76ad9e7f8b6ee8e2d1f214a484d6182393be717) on 2026-09-26.

Modifications by Novaeon Studio, from 2026-09-26 on, include: product name and branding; a new
visual design; a simple mode for non-traders; new pages (home, positions, markets, trades,
journal, strategy, wallet, command center, cockpit); position charts with stop, break-even and
liquidation levels; manual buys and stop changes; practice-money funding; MetaMask / Hyperliquid
wallet connection; notifications; installable web app. The complete list of changes is in the
version history of https://github.com/NovaeonStudio/novaeon-trading-ai.


2. The bot (bot/)
-----------------

The strategy in bot/strategies/ is written against the Freqtrade strategy interface and runs
inside the Freqtrade trading engine, https://github.com/freqtrade/freqtrade
  Copyright (C) the Freqtrade contributors
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.

installer/lib/ensure-engine-patches.sh applies a small modification to an installed copy of Freqtrade
(it raises the database connection pool size). The modified file remains under the GNU General
Public License, version 3. Freqtrade itself is installed from its official releases and is not
redistributed in this repository.

The strategy, the control service and the other files in bot/ are Copyright (C) 2026 Novaeon
Studio and licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.


